        -:  427:        @ref memory_resource used by `other`. After construction,
        -:  428:        the moved-from string behaves as if newly
        -:  429:        constructed with its current memory resource.
        -:  430:
        -:  431:        @par Complexity
        -:  432:
        -:  433:        Constant.
