        -: 1452:        This increases the capacity of the array to a value
        -: 1453:        that is greater than or equal to `new_capacity`. If
        -: 1454:        `new_capacity > capacity()`, new memory is
        -: 1455:        allocated. Otherwise, the call has no effect.
