        -: 1469:
        -: 1470:        If new memory is allocated, all iterators including
        -: 1471:        any past-the-end iterators, and all references to
        -: 1472:        the elements are invalidated. Otherwise, no
        -: 1473:        iterators or references are invalidated.
        -: 1474:
        -: 1475:        @param new_capacity The new capacity of the array.
        -: 1476:
        -: 1477:        @throw system_error `new_capacity > max_size()`
        -: 1478:    */
        -: 1479:    void
